2.2 Input dataset
---------------------------------------------
The model is driven by the fifth-generation European Centre for Medium-range Weather Forecasts atmospheric reanalysis (ERA5). The model is initialized at 0000 universal coordinated time (UTC) 1 October 1979 and updated every 3 h at the lateral and lower boundaries using the ERA5 reanalysis data. The model time step is 20s throughout the simulation period. 


